      en: ["The Rohtang Pass and Banihal Pass are in this range.", "Largest range of the Lesser Himalayas.", "Composed of volcanic rocks.", "Pir Panjal Range is located in the state of Himachal Pradesh and is a well-known mountain.", "The region attracts many visitors each year from India and abroad.", "Local culture and language are closely tied to the identity of Himachal Pradesh."]
